;
; Show this post to this seat (hamlet_rules.h HR2), in MYRA: the seat's
; view of a post filed as ^ZXHAMLETSEE, its two margins as $H days, so a
; margin below 0 does not fit (MYRA's date is 0 to 2980013). roleroom is
; the seat's role minus member (below 0: not a member of the post's
; group); muteroom is minus the mutes that cover the post (below 0: muted).
; show.eve holds each to its meaning (roleroom 0..2, muteroom 0); a larger
; margin fits a day and not the meaning: held.
^ZXHAMLETSEE(roleroom:d) = muteroom:d!
